## 3. Raspberry Pi (Python)

Dependency check performed via:
```
licensecheck --requirements-paths ./requirements.txt --license gpl-3.0
```

All resolved dependencies (`aiohttp`, `bleak`, `pyyaml`, `attrs`, and their transitive dependencies) are licensed under **MIT**, **Apache-2.0**, **BSD-2-Clause**, or the **Python Software Foundation License** — all compatible with GPLv3. No elections or exclusions required.

