## 4. Arduino Firmware

Libraries declared in `platformio.ini` (`lib_deps`):

### 4.1 Adafruit BME680 Library — BSD License
### 4.2 Adafruit Unified Sensor — Apache License 2.0

Both compatible with GPLv3. Per the BSD notice embedded in Adafruit's source files, the following must accompany any redistribution of this code:

> Written by Limor Fried/Ladyada for Adafruit Industries. BSD license, all text above must be included in any redistribution.

### 4.3 ArduinoBLE — GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 (or later)

LGPL-licensed code may be combined with and distributed as part of a GPLv3-licensed work; no further action required.

### 4.4 Grove - LCD RGB Backlight (Seeed Studio) — MIT License (core) / LGPL 2.1 (bundled examples)

The core library source (`rgb_lcd.h`, `rgb_lcd.cpp`) carries an MIT license header. At least one bundled example sketch (`HelloWorld.ino`) instead carries an LGPL 2.1 header — an inconsistency present in the upstream Seeed Studio repository, not introduced by ClimateCanary. Both licenses are independently compatible with GPLv3.

