## Summary

All third-party dependencies across all four subsystems have been reviewed and are either natively compatible with GPLv3, or have had a compatible license explicitly elected (where a dual-license choice was offered), or have been excluded from the build (AspectJ). No incompatible dependencies remain in the distributed project.